    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark Ranger&quot; is a\u00a0light\u00a0roguelike\u00a0strategy RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play\u00a0as\u00a0a\u00a0middle- aged,\u00a0retired\u00a0knight\u00a0who\u00a0returns\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0battlefield\u00a0for\u00a0one\u00a0last\u00a0chance\u00a0at\u00a0glory.\u00a0Weapons\u00a0switch\u00a0automatically\u00a0based\u00a0on\u00a0distance\u2014daggers\u00a0for\u00a0close\u00a0combat,\u00a0spears\u00a0for\u00a0reach,\u00a0axes\u00a0for\u00a0sweeping\u00a0attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills\u00a0are\u00a0formed\u00a0by\u00a0chaining\u00a0stance\u00a0cards\u00a0into\u00a0combos:\u00a0like\u00a0[Turn\u00a0+\u00a0Turn\u00a0+\u00a0Sword]\u00a0to\u00a0unleash\u00a0Whirlwind\u00a0Slash,\u00a0or\u00a0[Advance\u00a0+\u00a0Retreat\u00a0+\u00a0Spear]\u00a0for\u00a0a\u00a0deadly\u00a0counter.\u00a0Tactical\u00a0positioning\u00a0and\u00a0adaptation\u00a0are\u00a0key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique combat system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/adc82cb4f98ae170a2aa285bed681978.poster.avif?t=1753120410\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/adc82cb4f98ae170a2aa285bed681978.webm?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/adc82cb4f98ae170a2aa285bed681978.mp4?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A variety of monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/c24ebb9554f4450c34228149e8aabefb.poster.avif?t=1753120410\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/c24ebb9554f4450c34228149e8aabefb.webm?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/c24ebb9554f4450c34228149e8aabefb.mp4?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique in-battle items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/2920c404aaa34679dd8726259ceb8500.poster.avif?t=1753120410\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/2920c404aaa34679dd8726259ceb8500.webm?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/2920c404aaa34679dd8726259ceb8500.mp4?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various weapon types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/c2a746b6bf40c5447eb1941317306c74.poster.avif?t=1753120410\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/c2a746b6bf40c5447eb1941317306c74.webm?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/c2a746b6bf40c5447eb1941317306c74.mp4?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark Ranger&quot; is a\u00a0light\u00a0roguelike\u00a0strategy RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play\u00a0as\u00a0a\u00a0middle- aged,\u00a0retired\u00a0knight\u00a0who\u00a0returns\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0battlefield\u00a0for\u00a0one\u00a0last\u00a0chance\u00a0at\u00a0glory.\u00a0Weapons\u00a0switch\u00a0automatically\u00a0based\u00a0on\u00a0distance\u2014daggers\u00a0for\u00a0close\u00a0combat,\u00a0spears\u00a0for\u00a0reach,\u00a0axes\u00a0for\u00a0sweeping\u00a0attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills\u00a0are\u00a0formed\u00a0by\u00a0chaining\u00a0stance\u00a0cards\u00a0into\u00a0combos:\u00a0like\u00a0[Turn\u00a0+\u00a0Turn\u00a0+\u00a0Sword]\u00a0to\u00a0unleash\u00a0Whirlwind\u00a0Slash,\u00a0or\u00a0[Advance\u00a0+\u00a0Retreat\u00a0+\u00a0Spear]\u00a0for\u00a0a\u00a0deadly\u00a0counter.\u00a0Tactical\u00a0positioning\u00a0and\u00a0adaptation\u00a0are\u00a0key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique combat system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/adc82cb4f98ae170a2aa285bed681978.poster.avif?t=1753120410\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/adc82cb4f98ae170a2aa285bed681978.webm?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/adc82cb4f98ae170a2aa285bed681978.mp4?t=1753120410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A variety of monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424920/extras/c24ebb9554f4450c34228149e8aabefb.poster.avif?t=1753120410\" width=600 h